// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (same directory) and fill in real values.
// Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored; it feeds Info.plist via Version.xcconfig's optional
// include, so local archives and TestFlight uploads carry the keys.
// Xcode Cloud: set CHANGENOW_API_KEY as a (secret) environment variable in the workflow -
// ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh writes this file from it before the build.
CHANGENOW_API_KEY = your-changenow-api-key-here
